"note_claim": "The 13,099 figure represents non-citizens with homicide convictions on the non-detained docket as of July 2024, covering decades rather than just 2024.",
"label": "SUPPORTS",
"quote": "They show that, as of July 2024, there were 425,431 non-citizens with criminal convictions on ICE's \"non-detained docket\"... Of these: 13,099 were convicted of homicide",
"reason": "The article confirms the 13,099 figure comes from the July 2024 non-detained docket, covers convictions over many years, and includes individuals in prison under other agencies."
